  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Stronger, more public allied defence commitments increase the likelihood of coordinated security-driven industrial policies and decoupling, raising perceived geopolitical risk and lowering investor appetite for AI exposures connected to rival states such as China.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
