  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Elevated allied defense commitments to deterring or supporting operations in the Russia–Ukraine theatre draw air‑defense, ISR and strike assets and political bandwidth away from the Middle East, weakening deterrence and increasing the propensity for reciprocal escalation cycles by Iran‑aligned actors.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
