  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">A surge in visible armed strikes raises geopolitical risk premiums and insurance costs for China-facing tech operations, causing some investors to delay or withdraw funding for AI ventures exposed to China trade frictions.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_proxy_escalation</data>
