  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">Sharp increases in cross-border missile/drone attacks create immediate uncertainty about supply, insurance and geopolitical risk, triggering spikes in implied and realized volatility across equities and bonds.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_proxy_escalation</data>
  <data key="d39">global_economic_strain</data>
